<div class="boxbgcolor5">
<h4><% __('A message from the TGC') |h %></h4>
<& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('The 2014 Report of the Tomato Genetics Cooperative (TGC) will likely be published at the end of October.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('There is time for researchers to submit reports on their tomato related research.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Reports can include some interesting preliminary results and will not preclude later publishing in a refereed journal.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('You may also have some information that would be of interest to the research community but do not have time etc. to do follow up work for a refereed paper.') &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('Please submit reports to me at {link}{email}{end_link}.'), link => '<a href="mailto:jwsc@ufl.edu">', email => 'jwsc@ufl.edu', end_link => '</a>' &> <& /util/sentence.mas, text => __x('For more information on the TGC see {link}{address}{end_link}.'), link => '<a href="http://tgc.ifas.ufl.edu">', address => 'http://tgc.ifas.ufl.edu', end_link => '</a>' &>
<br /><br />
-Jay Scott<br />
<% __('Managing Editor Tomato Genetics Cooperative') |h %>
</div>